**Journal:** *Bioresources and Bioprocessing* (2026)

**DOI:** https://doi.org/10.1186/s40643-026-01126-0

This work presents the metabolic engineering of *Thermothelomyces heterothallica* for cellobionate production, highlighting the potential of fungal metabolic engineering for the sustainable biomanufacturing of value-added bioproducts from renewable biomass.
